From: Claude <claude@buttzeppelin>
Date: Sun, 18 Oct 2026 12:43:50 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Zeppelin F-171: 100-slot quest log

- Player fields: 75 quest slots x 5 appended after PLAYER_END (0x52E -> 1701 dwords), local data + mirror lists sized from it
- Quest log UI arrays, POIs, sort types and Lua MAX_QUESTS/MAX_QUESTLOG_QUESTS raised to 100
- Party member quest checks stay on the 25 stock slots (remote players carry only the stock fields)

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01ByrZ7GxoHC9wfGdkRwtqCX
